OL,3,GNEWSAThree teenagers die after car
OL,4,Aenters river
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree teenagers have died after a car
OL,7,Fentered the River Wear.
OL,9,FNorthumbria Police said just before
OL,10,F13:30 BST a black Audi A3 came off the
OL,11,Froad at Panns Bank near Wearmouth
OL,12,FBridge, in Sunderland, and entered the
OL,13,Fwater.
OL,15,FFour people were in the car at the time
OL,16,Fand a 17-year-old boy managed to reach
OL,17,Fsafety. He is currently in hospital
OL,18,Fwith non-serious injuries, and has
OL,19,Fsubsequently been arrested in
OL,20,Fconnection with the incident, the force
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
